mfing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":60600320,"digest":"sha256:a6c9043fa97086396107874a73b130f88681510ff5789685b9bc00e70d420ab1","download_count":24,"created_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:48Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:51Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/imfing/m1plus-music/releases/download/1.0.0/update.bin"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imfing/m1plus-music/tarball/1.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imfing/m1plus-music/zipball/1.0.0","body":"The first release of M1+ Music: a modern music-player interface for the **Shanling M1 Plus**, built on the official V2.1 firmware.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Browse:** Cover Flow, album grids and lists, Artists, an A–Z Songs list, Playlists and library search.\n- **Home:** Daily Mix, Recently Played and a floating mini player.\n- **Now Playing:** cover-colour backgrounds, rounded artwork, remaining time, a queue page and full-screen lyrics.\n- **Extras:** album and folder shuffle, local podcasts, a virtual iPod, Cassette Mode, Vinyl Mode and an online cover and lyrics lookup.\n- **Appearance:** a translucent lock screen, a minimal theme, Lucide icons and Inter + Source Han Sans fonts.\n- **Settings:** choose the menu items, startup behaviour, Cover Flow orientation, album order and a battery percentage.\n- **Languages:** the added screens follow the player's language setting, in 13 translations.\n\nStock settings and Tidal remain available. See the [user guide](https://github.com/imfing/m1plus-music/blob/main/docs/guide.md) for the controls.\n\n## Install\n\nCopy `update.bin` to the root of the card, then on the player open **System settings → System Update → TF card update**. Only the kernel and rootfs are updated; the bootloader and recovery stay untouched. To go back to stock, install the official V2.1 `update.bin` the same way. Full steps: [installation guide](https://github.com/imfing/m1plus-music/blob/main/docs/install.md).\n\nThe About page shows **M1+ Music 1.0.0** below the stock V2.1.\n\n`update.bin` SHA-256: `a6c9043fa97086396107874a73b130f88681510ff5789685b9bc00e70d420ab1`\n"}